# Only the Inter face Grimoire actually loads is needed at build/runtime.
# The rest of the package (every weight/italic x 18/24/28pt optical sizes + the
# variable fonts) has no build or runtime role -- keep it out of git. Mirror this
# file's allow-list if EditorFonts.cpp starts loading another cut.
*
!.gitignore
!OFL.txt
!static/
static/*
!static/Inter_18pt-Regular.ttf
